<title>COLOMBIA: Colombian foreign reserves rise to $9.8 bln Feb 14.</title>
<headline>Colombian foreign reserves rise to $9.8 bln Feb 14.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's net foreign reserves rose to $9.802 billion as of February 14, the last date for which official figures are available, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said the figure marked a $10 million increase over Feburary 7, but was down from the record high $9.896 billion reported at the close of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
